lg:PL-ADR-art31-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2b24ee655aef4bffb112aa2f652c39d9e2930560e8187d3c4c3ef4b66c34173a" ;
    lgo:text "1. A trader who has committed itself or is obliged under separate provisions to use out-of-court resolution of consumer disputes shall inform consumers of the competent authorised entity."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ADR-art31-1-q1 .

lg:PL-ADR-art31-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e2a3caa470e5b9bd785b395be2092160b27af6bc86f96b6d3d7e333b67f5661f" ;
    lgo:text """2. The information referred to in paragraph 1, covering at least the website address of the authorised entity, is made available in a manner understandable and easily accessible to the consumer, including:
1) on the trader's website, if the trader maintains one;
2) in the contract templates concluded with consumers, if the trader uses such."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ADR-art31-2-q1 .

lg:PL-ADR-art32-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ba7f24445d5ebb6ca688ebd5e7a03bc30a48778f6a301bb9afe2bff500bde2a6" ;
    lgo:text """1. Where, following a complaint submitted by the consumer, the dispute has not been resolved, the trader shall provide the consumer on paper or another durable medium with a statement of:
1) the intention to submit a request to initiate out-of-court consumer dispute resolution proceedings or consent to participate in such proceedings, or
2) the refusal to participate in out-of-court consumer dispute resolution proceedings."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ADR-art32-1-q1 .

lg:PL-ADR-art32-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "910e75fbd7c3cf22a49ad806b430321fdd6b63f161110b7a3934d87619ee9f2f" ;
    lgo:text "2. In the case referred to in paragraph 1 point 1, the trader shall, together with the statement, provide information about the competent authorised entity for that trader."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ADR-art32-2-q1 .

lg:PL-ADR-art32-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a7f763e296130ac230d0264a327bedee8f4afae98b604e0b1a7f4b73bb8b4808" ;
    lgo:text "3. If the trader has not made any statement, it is deemed to consent to participate in out-of-court consumer dispute resolution proceedings."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ADR-art32-3-q1 .

lg:PL-ADR-title-c4832111f0b1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c4832111f0b19b8b268999dc5c3c904b90b6f379767912aa19a996d1fa8eb47f" ;
    lgo:text "Act of 23 September 2016 on out-of-court resolution of consumer disputes"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
