lg:PL-ASDE-art5-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "0c25841f164142ed8fe41577fa648edb79110e309de7c71034a681c193cb8d6e" ;
    lgo:text "1. A service provider gives the basic information specified in sections 2-5 in a manner that is clear, unambiguous and directly accessible through the ICT system used by the service recipient."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ASDE-art5-1-q1 .

lg:PL-ASDE-art5-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "66fc330d3cb7e1ed278e4b42da458a3b172b75cf11ad6920a3adefb40cadc631" ;
    lgo:text """2. A service provider gives:
1) electronic addresses,
2) its given name, surname, place of residence and address, or its name or business name together with its seat and address."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ASDE-art5-2-q1 .

lg:PL-ASDE-art5-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a89eba94356a1b2de2e518e500eb399e539a89e1d298b184dae713c238f12ef8" ;
    lgo:text "3. Where the service provider is an entrepreneur, it also gives information on the competent authorisation and the authorising body, where the provision of the service requires such an authorisation under separate provisions."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ASDE-art5-3-q1 .

lg:PL-ASDE-art5-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e2eb8595d03e505010b29e53ed9f67231ae6b770cf59e4c30972fa31587358cb" ;
    lgo:text """5. Where the service provider is a natural person whose right to exercise a profession is subject to requirements laid down in separate acts, it also gives:
1) where a representative has been appointed, the representative's given name, surname, place of residence and address, or its name or business name together with its seat and address,
2) the professional body to which it belongs,
3) the professional title it uses and the state in which it was conferred,
4) its number in the public register in which it is entered, together with the name of the register and the authority maintaining it,
5) information on the existence of professional ethics rules applicable to the profession and on how they can be accessed."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ASDE-art5-5-q1 .

lg:PL-ASDE-title-520ac656c921-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "520ac656c921a75a9665d06c4bd09c0c8c9c52c2b1ef48d050e7bdb5a50cdcf8" ;
    lgo:text "Act of 18 July 2002 on the provision of services by electronic means"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-ASDE .

lg:PL-KSH-art127-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a2abb706c994337e245d2e70337903d765bd7430893a5a47968bc97af79f468e" ;
    lgo:text """§ 5. Letters and commercial orders issued by a limited joint-stock partnership in paper and electronic form, as well as information on the company's websites, shall contain:
1) the company's name, its registered office and address;
2) the designation of the registry court in which the company's documentation is kept and the number under which the company is entered in the register;
3) the tax identification number (NIP);
4) the amount of the share capital and the paid-up capital."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-KSH-art127-5-q1 .

lg:PL-KSH-art206-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "40142020c9f3ba3e7f5ed2360361087b6f699b34c5e25c65ca7e54e1670f53f6" ;
    lgo:text """§ 1. Letters and commercial orders issued by the company in paper and electronic form, as well as information on the company's websites, shall contain:
1) the company's name, its registered office and address;
2) the designation of the registry court in which the company's documentation is kept and the number under which the company is entered in the register;
3) the tax identification number (NIP);
4) the amount of the share capital, and for a company whose articles of association were concluded using a template, until the share capital is covered, also the information that the required contributions to the share capital have not been made;
5) the designation of the group of companies, if the company belongs to one."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-KSH-art206-1-q1 .

lg:PL-KSH-art206-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f3541df70679c567a65d18007ec87356753062710dea0f4cc1a73b2cd9b9497c" ;
    lgo:text "§ 3. The provision of § 1 applies mutatis mutandis to a branch of a limited liability company having its seat abroad."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-KSH-art206-3-q1 .

