    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f3b6833005425b4aba118e0f32e84c7cd476099d7e7d9dcb17e933e08ac5912f" ;
    lgo:text """§ 1. Letters and commercial orders issued by the company in paper and electronic form, as well as information on the company's websites, shall contain:
1) the company's name, its registered office and address;
2) the designation of the registry court in which the company's documentation is kept, and the number under which the company is entered in the register;
3) the tax identification number (NIP);
4) the amount of the share capital;
5) the designation of the group of companies, if the company belongs to one."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-KSH-art300-61-1-q1 .

lg:PL-KSH-art300-61-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "daf12bd2624e90e917e551700ec93996951f4c121929fcb681e2dcfd3eb28837" ;
    lgo:text "§ 2. In letters and commercial orders issued by the company in paper form, instead of the amount of the share capital as at the date the letter or commercial order was drawn up, the company may show the share capital as at the last day of the previous financial year, indicating that day. If the company was not obliged to prepare financial statements as at the last day of the previous financial year, it shall show the amount of the share capital as at the date of the company's entry in the register."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-KSH-art300-61-2-q1 .

