lg:PL-UJP-art7-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e96de778f1913720545952db919e557fea9322bb5ec777de00309d396ba2a6a0" ;
    lgo:text "1. The Polish language is used in legal transactions on the territory of the Republic of Poland between Polish entities and where one of the parties is a Polish entity. This concerns in particular the naming of goods and services, offers, advertising, operating instructions, information on the properties of goods and services, warranty terms, invoices, bills and receipts."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-UJP-art7-1-q1 .

lg:PL-UJP-art7-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "94a289e1e928eef8324e532662eefc7ab9e88f39f7836cca00c77b9cabbb6ef9" ;
    lgo:text """2. A Polish entity within the meaning of the Act is:
1) a natural person residing on the territory of the Republic of Poland,
2) a legal person or an organisational unit without legal personality — carrying on activity on the territory of the Republic of Poland."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-UJP-art7-2-q1 .

lg:PL-UJP-art7-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "9d2e639cec1d9657f65589058b5af6d3662efa7b8cde5b1a18dfe89357798e4b" ;
    lgo:text "3. The use in legal transactions on the territory of the Republic of Poland of exclusively foreign-language designations, with the exception of proper names, is prohibited."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-UJP-art7-3-q1 .

lg:PL-UJP-art7-4-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c24ee9ccb37730e494398e8d2af05bfdcf23d18023e54c60ccfe25eb03151495" ;
    lgo:text "4. Foreign-language descriptions of goods and services and foreign-language offers and advertising introduced into the legal transactions referred to in paragraph 1 must simultaneously have a Polish-language version."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-UJP-art7-4-q1 .

lg:PL-UJP-art7-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f69efe75a85544308aaf861613d99b5127a3f1e7b2bbc5949b8492eb7c940783" ;
    lgo:text "5. Compliance with the duties referred to in paragraphs 1, 3 and 4 is supervised by the Trade Inspection and the Office of Competition and Consumer Protection."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PL-UJP-art7-5-q1 .

